# Default schedule, baked into the image. Bind-mount your own file to
# config/crontab to override it entirely -- plain 5-field cron syntax +
# command, no user column (supercronic runs everything as the container's
# own user). Multiple lines = multiple independent schedules/config files.

*/10 * * * * organize run /app/config/organize.yaml && touch /app/state/heartbeat
